"en"
:
"Key configuration options:\n- zero_harness: Default AI tool (sometimes called \"harness\" internally)\n\nClaude family: claude, claude-openrouter, claude-deepseek, claude-kimi, claude-moonshot, claude-zhipu, claude-siliconflow, claude-doubao, claude-mthreads, claude-minimax, claude-ali, claude-baidu, claude-tencent\nOthers: codex, codex-ds, cursor, gemini-cli, opencode, kimi-cli, x-chat\n"
}
]
,
